1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,460
You see your crush, and your face goes red.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,051
Here's why.

3
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,853
Your fight-or-flight system switches on.

4
00:00:05,853 --> 00:00:09,710
Nerves and adrenaline tell the blood vessels in your face to widen.

5
00:00:10,217 --> 00:00:14,295
Your cheeks are packed with tiny blood vessels, close to the surface.

6
00:00:14,295 --> 00:00:17,309
So the extra blood shows, and your face feels warm.

7
00:00:17,817 --> 00:00:20,235
And you can't fake a blush, or switch it off.

8
00:00:20,235 --> 00:00:21,041
It's automatic.

9
00:00:21,341 --> 00:00:23,514
Like and subscribe for more Crush Files.

10
00:00:24,017 --> 00:00:28,897
Charles Darwin called blushing the most peculiar and the most human of all expressions.

11
00:00:29,383 --> 00:00:30,791
And it may even help.

12
00:00:30,791 --> 00:00:35,753
In one Dutch study led by Corine Dijk, people rated faces after a mistake.

13
00:00:35,753 --> 00:00:38,971
Blushing faces were mostly rated more favorably.

14
00:00:39,483 --> 00:00:40,502
So that red face?

15
00:00:40,502 --> 00:00:42,480
It's just your body being honest.

16
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,397
More Crush Files on the channel.
